        <title>Daylight</title>
        <item>
            <title>3.1.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 10:24:29 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>32</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Edit on your desktop: press Control-Option-D and your wallpaper becomes a calendar you can click. Pick a day, type “Lunch 1pm”, press Return.</li><li>New Calendar layout: the whole month edge to edge, with no big date and no times.</li><li>New Stage and Aurora backgrounds, drawn sharp at full screen.</li><li>Save looks and switch between them in one click. Use the wallpaper you had before Daylight as a backdrop.</li><li>Sunday dates and today stay readable on dark photos.</li></ul>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/LeBronFanCW/daylight/releases/download/v3.1.0/Daylight-macOS.zip" sparkle:edSignature="EQYx73xt2JsXLqfebCuGTRnlwj/0z/XJYO8N8MKiDzVWL0dT2d2XwqgYWNtukJ6y44uf7ep323KEvtBOWAwBCw==" length="3181865" type="application/octet-stream"/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>3.0.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 09:43:37 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>31</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.0.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Rebuilt from scratch. Daylight now sets your real wallpaper, so your calendar shows on every Space and on the Lock Screen.</li><li>Uses every calendar in the Calendar app (iCloud, Google, Outlook). Choose which ones show.</li><li>Month, Week, Agenda and Focus layouts, seven themes, your own photo, fonts and colours.</li><li>Press Control-Option-Space anywhere and type things like “Dentist tue 3pm” to add them.</li><li>Your next meeting sits in the menu bar, with a Join button for Zoom, Meet and Teams.</li><li>Small updates now install quietly in the background.</li></ul>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/LeBronFanCW/daylight/releases/download/v3.0.0/Daylight-macOS.zip" sparkle:edSignature="7XMNbBOGNg4muARzbNWtD1Gu2eTImj9QMzhN0S1U1dVIjXpai0m8wtv6mWaqhSSqNVTMM38FBYl4GeQrJD1lAg==" length="3044346" type="application/octet-stream"/>
        </item>
